      "id": 1,
      "text": "The Power & Light District takes its name from the art‑deco Kansas City Power and Light Building.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kansas_City_Power_%26_Light_District",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A July 2004 master plan by Beyer Blinder Belle Architects set the district on a pedestrian‑friendly, art‑deco‑preserving path.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Kansas_City_Power_&_Light_District",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Spanning 13.7 acres across nine city blocks, the district houses over 50 restaurants, bars, and the 18,000‑seat T‑Mobile Center arena.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Kansas_City_Power_&_Light_District",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The renovated Midland Theatre, reopened in 2008, anchors the district’s live‑music scene with concerts and performances.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Kansas_City_Power_&_Light_District",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "One Light Luxury Apartments opened in 2015, while Two Light added a 438‑space garage and Spark KC coworking space.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17,
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.powerandlightdistrict.com/en/News/Inside-the-rise-of-the-Power-and-Light-District",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "After decades of failed revitalization, the district transformed blighted downtown parking lots into a vibrant entertainment hub.",
